		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-3" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">2.</FONT><FONT CLASS="Adobe" STYLE="font-family:Adobe Song Std L, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:300;text-decoration:underline;">&#x5b9a;&#x4e49;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Adobe" STYLE="font-family:Adobe Song Std L, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:300;">&#x3002;</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-4" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-5" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(a)&#x00a0;</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-6" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;">Act</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-5" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. The U.S. Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended.</FONT></P>
