		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-4" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-5" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(e)&#x00a0;</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-6" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;">Beneficiary</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-5" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. The person or persons entitled to receive a benefit pursuant to an Award upon the death of a Participant.</FONT></P>
