		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-3" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-5" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">4.&#x00a0; </FONT><FONT CLASS="Adobe" STYLE="font-family:Adobe Song Std L, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:300;text-decoration:underline;">&#x80a1;&#x7968;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Adobe" STYLE="font-family:Adobe Song Std L, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:300;">&#x3002;</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-6" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:21pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-5" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(a) Subject to Section&#x00a0;12 of the Plan, there shall be reserved for issuance under the Plan a total of </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-5" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">5,000,000 </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-5" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> unissued shares of Company Stock.</FONT></P>
